  "body": "The proposed WebIDL for this API includes a SerialConnectionEvent. The TAG design principles [suggest](https://w3ctag.github.io/design-principles/#state-and-subclassing) using a generic event and storing state in the `target` attribute. This change would require moving the `connect` and `disconnect` event handler attributes to the `SerialPort` interface and defining that events bubble from `SerialPort` instances to the singleton `Serial` instance.",
